    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479240/extras/de82483cc6633159f929b7df205dced6.webp?t=1746658554\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grabby Lust Ghost</strong> is a chaotic point-and-click puzzle horror game with a cozy yet eerie atmosphere. <br>Mix ingredients, solve riddles, and navigate a haunted world where nothing stays stable for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Ella's ghostly kitchen by combining 3 ingredients into her mysterious cauldron, each mix can create new recipes, unlock new encounters with Ella, or accidentally trigger bizarre glitched events. Experimentation is key!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479240/extras/e8786c01ea886d786021b39abbed5b20.poster.avif?t=1746658554\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479240/extras/e8786c01ea886d786021b39abbed5b20.webm?t=1746658554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479240/extras/e8786c01ea886d786021b39abbed5b20.mp4?t=1746658554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf <strong>Explore 5 spooky locations</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ella's Haunted Kitchen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Forgotten Well</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Corrupted Library</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ella\u2019s BBQ Den</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ghostly Shopping Market</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Unlock new ingredients</strong>\u00a0<strong>and shop items</strong> as you level up and defeat mischievous spirits. Unlock the &quot;poker&quot; allowing you to earn money by poking Ella. Place your bets on 3 little gambling machines!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Solve 28 riddles</strong> hidden in ancient books to uncover secret recipes.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Customize Ella</strong> with 4 unlockable outfits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd69 <strong>Collect 26 strange ingredients</strong> to create dishes, unlock secrets, and encounter unexpected glitches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Survive the Glitches</strong>:<br>Something\u2019s wrong with the video tape... Combining ingredients may lead to corrupted visuals, distorted sound, or chaotic gameplay changes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Poke the Ghost</strong>:<br>She's ticklish, interact with Ella for funny reactions!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player</strong> experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated playtime</strong>: ~2-6 hours depending on exploration and experimentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings and secret unlockables</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Best enjoyed by fans of quirky horror, point-and-click puzzles, and experimental gameplay</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479240/extras/5c616d468e29cc4f83f6457d08eed2ba.avif?t=1746658554\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEED ME BBQ!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479240/extras/b9faba9eb233a00c75ab38f46000b708.poster.avif?t=1746658554\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479240/extras/b9faba9eb233a00c75ab38f46000b708.webm?t=1746658554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
